{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25725","headline":"初日照凤楼 · 李虞仲","name":"初日照凤楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旭日烟云殿，朝阳烛帝居。\n断霞生峻宇，通阁丽晴虚。\n流彩连朱槛，腾辉照绮疏。\n曈曨晨景里，明灭晓光初。\n户牖仙山近，轩楹凤翼舒。\n还如王母过，遥度五云车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李虞仲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}